    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-spacer height="20px"></mj-spacer>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 1px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="10px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.singaporesummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.singaporesummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Palm Tree Music Festival Singapore
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text
      padding="0px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Palm Tree Music Festival makes its Singapore debut this weekend, bringing a strong lineup led by Alesso and John Summit. Expect an afternoon-to-night experience with music, food, and a well-produced festival setup.
</p>
<p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  Known for its more refined format, the festival focuses on smaller crowds, better access, and elevated hospitality. With options from general admission to VIP and table service, it offers a more comfortable way to enjoy a large-scale music event.
</p>
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  🔗 <strong>Link:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #660000;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://premier.ticketek.com.sg/shows/show.aspx?sh=PTMF26"
  target="_blank"
>See ticket options</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> Sat, Apr 18, 3 pm - 10:30 pm<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> S$190 - S$888<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #660000;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://premier.ticketek.com.sg/shows/show.aspx?sh=PTMF26"
  target="_blank"
>The Meadow, Gardens by the Bay</a>
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-spacer height="20px"></mj-spacer>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!--primary ad -->
    <mj-section
      background-color="#EFF1F4"
      css-class="border-line"
      padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
      border-radius="10px"
    >
      <mj-raw>
        <a href="https://link.singaporesummary.com/ss-10-apr-2026-p-ad-gf"
        target="_blank" style="color:black">
      </mj-raw>
      <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
        <mj-image
          border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
          padding="0px 0px 10px 0px"
          width="600px"
          src="https://www.singaporesummary.com/email/ad/10-apr-2026-p-ad-gf.jpg"
          alt="campaign - gf"
        />
        <mj-text
          padding="2px 12px 8px 12px"
          font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
          color="#000000"
        >
          <h2
            style="
              font-size: 24px;
              line-height: 1.2;
              font-weight: 500;
              margin-top: 2px !important;
              margin: 0;
            "
          >
            Access US real estate without buying property
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-spacer height="0px" />

        <mj-text
          padding="10px 12px 0px 12px"
          font-family="Arial"
          color="#000000"
        >
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px 0">
            <strong>What’s happening?</strong> Groundfloor is promoting its
            Notes as a simpler route into US real estate credit for investors
            who want predictable returns without directly buying, managing, or
            financing property themselves. Its Preferred Note offers accredited
            investors a 9.25% fixed return over a 6-month term with monthly
            payouts, while its Signature Notes offer up to 8.25% with 1, 3, and
            12-month options.
          </p>

          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px 0">
            <strong>For foreign investors:</strong> For international readers
            looking for exposure to US residential real estate without the
            hassle of cross-border property ownership, tenant issues, or long
            lockups, this is the cleaner pitch. Groundfloor says the Notes are
            backed by diversified pools of first-lien residential real estate
            loans, with fixed terms and clearly stated yields.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0">
            <strong>Track record:</strong> Groundfloor says it has operated
            since 2013 and that since launching Notes in 2018 it has made every
            scheduled principal and interest payment at maturity on its Notes.
            The Preferred Note is available to accredited investors only, with a
            $10,000 minimum and a $10 million cap, while Signature Notes are an
            option for non-accredited investors with lower minimums and flexible
            durations.
          </p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          padding="10px 12px 8px 12px"
          font-family="Roboto+Serif"
          color="#000000"
        >
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0">
            <a
              style="
                text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #660000;
                color: black;
              "
              ><strong
                >Lower minimum investment amounts and shorter tenures for
                Summary readers →</strong
              ></a
            >
          </p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-spacer height="12px" />
      </mj-column>
      <mj-raw> </a> </mj-raw> </mj-section
    ><!--primary ad -->

    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column padding="0px">
        <mj-spacer height="20px"></mj-spacer>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 1px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="10px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.singaporesummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.singaporesummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        À TABLE! – From Vines to Wine
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text
      padding="0px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  This exhibition takes visitors through the process of making wine, from grape growing to the final tasting experience. It explains how climate, soil, and craftsmanship shape each bottle, and why France is known for its wine culture.
</p>
<p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 15px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  The experience ends with a sensory focus, where you learn about aromas, textures, and how to enjoy wine. It’s a simple, self-guided visit suitable for beginners and those curious about wine.
</p>
      <p
  style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  "
>
  🔗 <strong>Link:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #660000;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/a-table-from-vines-to-wine-guided-tour-en-tickets-1980617863346"
  target="_blank"
>Reserve guided tour</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> Ends Apr 18, tour slots from 9 am - 6:45 pm<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Free entry &amp; Guided from S$10<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong>
<a
  style="
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #660000;
    color: black;
  "
  href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/a-table-from-vines-to-wine-guided-tour-en-tickets-1980617863346"
  target="_blank"
>La Galerie, Alliance Française de Singapour</a>
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

